   "text": "Brunel University London - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nBrunel University London - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nBrunel is located in Uxbridge, West London, and is ranked as one of the top 400 universities in the world by QS World University Rankings 2021 and the Times Higher Education World University Rankings 2021. Traditionally the university's strengths are in engineering, science, technology and social sciences, and Brunel students have access to specialist laboratories for electronic imaging, bioprocessing and experimental techniques; flight, driving and train simulators; a 3-D body scanner; an MRI scanner; motion-capture equipment; and an occupational therapy suite.\nThe International College offers world-class pathway programs leading to undergraduate and postgraduate degrees at Brunel University and is located inside Brunel University London Campus.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 05:50\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 07:46\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £15,267.00\nMin: £14,307.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n17%\n2,445 of 14,790 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1966\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V_sqz7ONMgE\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
